### pps-gpio

Activates pulse-per-second GPIO client

Parameters:

param_pps_pin (pin)
	Pin PPS source is connected to
	Optional
	Default: PD14

param_pps_falling_edge (bool)
	Assert by falling edge
	Optional
	Default: 0
	When set (to 1), assert is indicated by a falling edge
		(instead of by a rising edge)
